@startuml
title SSD part 3/3 - PRC charge, ledger, order summary and dispatch retry
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

actor "Customer" as C
actor "Courier" as CR
participant "Delivery\nService" as DS
participant "Fare\nNotifier" as FN
participant "Pricing\nStrategy" as PS
participant "Order" as O
participant "Fare\nLedger" as FL
participant "Ledger\nService" as LS
participant "Courier\nManager" as CM
participant "Dispatch\nQueue" as DQ

note over C, DQ : Precondition: order status = delivered (end of part 2/3)

== Charge and ledger (R-PRC-01, R-PRC-02, R-PRC-03) ==
DS -> FN : orderDelivered(order, courierId)
activate FN
FN -> PS : calculateBreakdown(orderLines)
activate PS
note right of PS
  Deterministic fare: subtotal + delivery fee + service fee
  + small-order surcharge (if subtotal < threshold).
  All values are read from the configuration file.
end note
PS --> FN : breakdown (subtotal, fees, surcharge, total)
deactivate PS
FN -> O : setPricingBreakdown(breakdown)
note right of O : Order summary is created after delivery
FN -> FL : record(ledger entry: final state, timestamps, total charge)
FN -> LS : recordCharge(orderId, total)
LS --> FN : CHARGE transaction recorded
FN --> C : order summary (items, fees, total charge)
deactivate FN

== Courier is idle again: retry the dispatch queue (R-DLV-04) ==
DS -> CM : updateAvailability(courier)
CM -> DQ : update(courier)
note right of DQ : Oldest waiting order is offered by the dispatch rule\n(same retry as in part 1/3)
DS --> CR : order delivered, status = idle
@enduml
